    "updated_at": "2020-09-14T09:39:33Z",
    "body": "That, or we define an I/O queue of scalar values that contains end-of-queue as being interchangeable with a scalar value string. That might also address the for each problem although I guess you'd not want end-of-queue to show up there... Or we define a string-returning version of the frequently invoked decoding algorithms.",
