    "created_at": "2021-04-15T17:49:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-15T17:49:19Z",
    "body": "It's pretty weird that you cannot (or can no longer?) apply UTF-8 decode to a byte sequence, but instead have to apply UTF-8 decode to the result of [converting](https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#to-i-o-queue-convert) the byte sequence into an I/O queue.",
